<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Holon</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Holon is a city on the central coastal plain of Israel, immediately south of Tel Aviv, founded in the 1930s. Besides its industry and residential districts, it is one of the two centres of the Samaritan community, alongside <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mount-gerizim">Mount Gerizim</a> near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nablus">Nablus</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samaritans">Samaritans</a> settled there in the mid-twentieth century.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/holon.jpg" alt="Holon" width="320" height="180" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: דוידי ורדי · CC BY 2.5 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:94765_holon_from_the_drone_PikiWiki_Israel.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
